{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Master of Paper Soccer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns kicking the ball towards your opponents goal, on a grid constrained pitch.<br>With each kick the ball leaves a trail. You cannot make the same trail twice.<br>If you kick the ball where there is an existing trail, you will be awarded another turn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a massive combination of kicks by strategically drawing trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to force a kick from your opponent with perfect ball placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the rivals goal by shaping up impenetrable trail walls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the simplicity of checkers, but the depth of chess,  jump in and start winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wait, you can win without scorring a goal?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410520/extras/36dabc3c0df4f2aafa0c4121ab8b93fd.poster.avif?t=1757429017\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410520/extras/36dabc3c0df4f2aafa0c4121ab8b93fd.webm?t=1757429017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410520/extras/36dabc3c0df4f2aafa0c4121ab8b93fd.mp4?t=1757429017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Friends, Public Matchmaking and Offline Bots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a game online,  spectate friends, or practice solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341